---
// The loop in GET /cases/{case_id}/guarded (demo/p08_cache.py, lines 102-128).
---
<figure class="bep8f">
  <div class="bep8f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 700 350" role="img" aria-label="Flow of the guarded read. Read the cache; on a hit, return. On a miss, try SET lock NX EX 5. The winner re-checks the cache, reads the database, writes the key and deletes the lock. A loser sleeps 0.02 seconds and reads the cache again, up to 100 times, then the request fails with 503.">
    <rect x="40" y="40" width="180" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="130" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="code">cache.get(key)</text>

    <line x1="220" y1="65" x2="340" y2="65" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="340,60 350,65 340,70" class="ah" />
    <text x="285" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="s">hit</text>
    <rect x="350" y="40" width="300" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="500" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>return the cached value</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả giá trị trong cache</tspan></text>

    <line x1="130" y1="90" x2="130" y2="150" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="125,150 130,160 135,150" class="ah" />
    <text x="146" y="128" class="s">miss</text>
    <rect x="40" y="160" width="180" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="130" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="code">SET lock NX EX 5</text>

    <line x1="220" y1="185" x2="340" y2="185" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="340,180 350,185 340,190" class="ah" />
    <text x="285" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>won</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thắng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="350" y="150" width="300" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="500" y="177" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>re-check, read the database,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra lại, đọc database,</tspan></text>
    <text x="500" y="199" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>write the key, delete the lock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi key, xoá lock</tspan></text>

    <line x1="130" y1="210" x2="130" y2="270" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="125,270 130,280 135,270" class="ah" />
    <text x="146" y="248" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thua</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="280" width="180" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="130" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="code">sleep 0.02 s</text>

    <path d="M40 305 H14 V65 H30" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="30,60 40,65 30,70" class="ah" />

    <line x1="220" y1="305" x2="340" y2="305" class="ln red" />
    <polygon points="340,300 350,305 340,310" class="ah red" />
    <text x="285" y="295" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>100 tries</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>100 lần</tspan></text>
    <rect x="350" y="280" width="300" height="50" rx="8" class="bad" />
    <text x="500" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="h red"><tspan data-lang-en>503 after about 2 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>503 sau khoảng 2 s</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One caller wins the lock and rebuilds. Everyone else loops back to the cache, with a hard limit so nobody waits forever. The thin line on the left is that loop.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một caller thắng lock và rebuild. Những caller còn lại quay lại đọc cache, có giới hạn cứng để không ai chờ mãi. Đường mảnh bên trái là vòng lặp đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 600px; height: auto; }
  .bep8f text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8f .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep8f .h.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8f .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8f .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8f .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8f .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8f .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep8f .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8f .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8f .ah.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
